Third-party assets and dependencies
-----------------------------------

Icons are from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), MIT licensed. The official SVG
path data is vendored verbatim into `src/ui/icons.ts` without modification;
see `scripts/gen-icons.ts` for the list and the regeneration step.

The distributed application also bundles the following, all permissively
licensed: js-yaml (MIT), zod (MIT), and the Tauri JavaScript APIs
`@tauri-apps/api`, `@tauri-apps/plugin-fs`, `@tauri-apps/plugin-dialog`
(MIT OR Apache-2.0). The Rust side links Tauri itself and its plugins
(MIT OR Apache-2.0); see `src-tauri/Cargo.lock` for the full set.
